    "messageId": "2107575657014468879",
    "url": "https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2107575657014468879",
    "text": "Roundup of Day 2/\n\n2.1/ Approve for me (auto-review) is now included and does not use usage. Can be between 2-10% of plan when used. Also better for you.\n2.2/ Simplified API for builders.\n2.3/ Meeting notes integrated.\n2.4/ Decisions API live for builders. Will use in the app to improve the experience.",
    "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T20:56:08.000Z",
    "collectedAt": "2026-10-15T17:35:45.418Z",
    "contextComplete": true,
    "provenance": "archive",
